<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Microchip a strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Microchip a strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Microchip Technology Inc was raised to a strong buy on Monday from its prior rating of buy at Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc, according to the brokerage firm.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1-1/2 to 5-1/4, hitting a new 52-week high of 50-3/8.</p>
<p>-- The company is based in Chandler, Arizona.</p>
</text>
